*   "What specific financial documents, communication logs, or other evidence do you need from me before the conference?"
*   "Are there any behavioral guidelines or communication boundaries I should strictly follow with the opposing party between now and the conference?"
*   "What are the best-case and worst-case scenarios for how this status conference will conclude?"

